cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference agent-md-specs in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-md-specs: A Proposed Vocabulary for AI Agent Identity, Governance, and Accountability"
abstract: >
  agent-md-specs is a proposed open vocabulary (draft, seeking review)
  of 179 Markdown file type specifications for AI agent identity,
  governance, and accountability — bridging human-readable policy with
  machine-enforceable Zero Trust security schemas. Released CC0 public
  domain. Submitted as a public comment to the NIST NCCoE AI Agent
  Standards Initiative (February 2026).
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TotalMarkdown.ai"
    website: "https://totalmarkdown.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/totalmarkdown/agent-md-specs"
url: "https://github.com/totalmarkdown/agent-md-specs"
license: CC0-1.0
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-04-03
keywords:
